    'mkt.label.result':   'Results',
    'mkt.label.learning': 'What I Learned',
    'mkt.context1':       'Migros wanted to be present at Swiss festivals and reach younger audiences. Titbit was commissioned to develop and execute brand activations – from concept to on-site delivery.',
    'mkt.role1':          'I was responsible for project planning, client coordination with Migros, quote preparation, supplier coordination and operational on-site management.',
