    'mkt.result1':        'All festival activations successfully delivered. Migros extended the partnership for the following year. Positive feedback on the accompanying social media content.',
    'mkt.learning1':      'How important clear briefings and early client alignment are – especially when last-minute changes on site are unavoidable.',
    'mkt.tag2':           'Case Study 02',
    'mkt.title2':         'Multimedia Award 2023 – Tonight Show Live Event',
    'mkt.context2':       'A live event show at Plaza Klub Zurich was to be produced for the Swiss Multimedia Award – from concept to execution.',
    'mkt.role2':          'I developed the show concept, hosted the event, directed the production, coordinated communications and led the technical production.',
    'mkt.action2.1':      'Developed show concept and run-of-show',
    'mkt.action2.2':      'Coordinated technical requirements with the venue',
    'mkt.action2.3':      'Hosted and directed the live show',
    'mkt.action2.4':      'Managed communications and social media around the event',
    'mkt.result2':        'Successful live show in front of a live audience. Media coverage on multimedia-award.ch.',
    'mkt.cta':            'Interested in my work?',
