    'app.r1-proof':    '10+ major Swiss festivals per year for Migros: Frauenfeld, Pal&eacute;o, Gampel, Heitere, Moon &amp; Stars, Stars in Town, Lumnezia, Luzern Live, Seaside, Summerdays and Summerstage.',
    'app.r1-role':     'Project Manager | Marketing, Events &amp; Brand Experience, TIT-PIT GmbH &ndash; with full client ownership.',
